  RM_GreySeaSaltCameo.xml             TerminalBiomes · authored 2026-09-27
  ============================================================================
  GREYSEA_RULED_CONTENT_1 housekeeping (grey_deep_sitting_agenda_2026-09-27.md
  §"Sitting housekeeping" / the danger-floor pass §3.3 point 1): "the rare-
  catch table and the salt cameo still carry the campaign-layer prefix while
  every named catch moved to the free tier — a small owed migration."

  RM_SaltCameo is the one salt cameo. Its campaign twin RUT_SaltCameo was folded into it
  (MATERIAL_MERGES_CLEANUP_1, 2026-10-09): RUT_RareGreyCatches names RM_SaltCameo, and a saved RUT_SaltCameo
